Subject: [PATCH 1002/3799] soh: rename func_80B43AD4 -> EnYukabyun_SpinUp

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: accelerates the tile's yaw spin while rising 30 units above home; once the spin passes 0x2000 it aims at the player, sets speed 10 and starts flying.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Yukabyun/z_en_yukabyun.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
